"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[22,25,78,60,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[22,25,78,60,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[22,25,78,60,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉名士，颍川鄢陵人，颍川庾氏始祖。庾乘出身微贱，年轻时在县廷当差看门。名士郭泰发现其才华，便劝庾乘到学宫求学。庾乘进入太学后，甘为诸生佣人，后能讲论经义。庾乘自认为门第卑微，每次讲论都坐于下座，诸生博士反而都前往与其辩论，于是学官中以下座为贵。朝廷多次征召庾乘，其都不应，时人称之为征君。","tc":"東漢名士，潁川鄢陵人，潁川庾氏始祖。庾乘出身微賤，年輕時在縣廷當差看門。名士郭泰發現其才華，便勸庾乘到學宮求學。庾乘進入太學后，甘為諸生傭人，后能講論經義。庾乘自認為門第卑微，每次講論都坐于下座，諸生博士反而都前往與其辯論，于是學官中以下座為貴。朝廷多次征召庾乘，其都不應，時人稱之為征君。","en":"A renowned scholar of the Eastern Han from Yanling in Yingchuan, and the founding ancestor of the Yingchuan Yu clan. Born into humble origins, Yu Cheng served as a gatekeeper at the county court in his youth. The noted scholar Guo Tai recognized his talent and urged him to pursue studies at the Academy. After entering the Academy, Yu Cheng willingly served as a laborer for fellow students, eventually mastering the exposition of the classics. Deeming his own background lowly, he always took a lower seat during academic discourses, yet scholars and Erudites alike flocked to debate with him, causing the lower seat to become honored throughout the Academy. The imperial court repeatedly summoned him to office, but he declined every summons, earning him the contemporary moniker of the ‘Summoned Gentleman.’","jp":"後漢の名士。潁川鄢陵の人で、潁川庾氏の始祖。庾乗は微賤の身の出身で、若き頃は県廷で門番を務めていた。名士の郭泰がその才能を見出し、学宮で学ぶよう勧めた。庾乗は太学に入ると、諸生の下僕として甘んじ働きながら学び、やがて経義を講じるまでになった。庾乗は自らの家柄の低さを顧みて、講論の際には常に下座に座していたが、諸生や博士たちはこぞって彼の元を訪れて議論を交わしたため、学官では下座こそが貴ばれるようになった。朝廷から度々召し出されたがすべて応じず、当時の人々から「徴君」と称された。","kr":"동한의 명사이자 영천 언릉 사람으로, 영천 유씨의 시조이다. 유승은 출신이 미천하여 젊은 시절 현정에서 문지기 노릇을 했다. 명사 곽태가 재능을 알아보고 학궁에 들어가 배움을 청하도록 권했다. 유승은 태학에 들어간 후 기꺼이 여러 유생의 허드렛일을 도맡았으며, 훗날 경전의 깊은 뜻을 강론할 수 있게 되었다. 유승은 스스로 문벌이 비천하다고 여겨 강론할 때마다 늘 하석에 앉았으나, 오히려 여러 유생과 박사들이 찾아와 함께 논변을 펼치니 이에 학관에서는 하석을 귀하게 여기게 되었다. 조정에서 여러 차례 유승을 징소하였으나 한 번도 응하지 않자, 당시 사람들은 정군(徵君)이라 일컬었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1036915","remark":"","surname":"庾","surnameTc":"庾","surnameEn":"Yu","surnameJp":"庾","surnameKr":"유","surnameOther":"","name":"乘","nameTc":"乘","nameEn":"Cheng","nameJp":"乗","nameKr":"승","nameOther":"","word":"世游","wordTc":"世游","wordEn":"Shiyou","wordJp":"世遊","wordKr":"세유","wordOther":"","icon":"庾乘","power":"WJ10048","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1026","gender":"0","rule":"22","force":"25","wise":"78","politics":"60","charm":"82","will":"85","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"15/15/77/15/15/88/74/15","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1000901","warSoulPoint":"4000","battleSoulPoint":"5000","debateSoulPoint":"5200","strategy":"1007315","strategy2":"1004801","professions":"2/1/0/1/2/0/1/3/2/1/3/1/1/3/0/2/3/4/3/2/2/1/3/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"4000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"130","show":"184","death":"190","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"6","weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1028705","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"8/1;12/1;15/1;27/1;33/1;41/1;68/0;31/0;44/0;21/0;38/0;39/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"WJ1037115/100;WJ1037015/100","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"WJ10082/6","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"东汉名士，颍川鄢陵人，颍川庾氏始祖。庾乘出身微贱，年轻时在县廷当差看门。名士郭泰发现其才华，便劝庾乘到学宫求学。庾乘进入太学后，甘为诸生佣人，后能讲论经义。庾乘自认为门第卑微，每次讲论都坐于下座，诸生博士反而都前往与其辩论，于是学官中以下座为贵。朝廷多次征召庾乘，其都不应，时人称之为征君。","descriptionTc":"東漢名士，潁川鄢陵人，潁川庾氏始祖。庾乘出身微賤，年輕時在縣廷當差看門。名士郭泰發現其才華，便勸庾乘到學宮求學。庾乘進入太學后，甘為諸生傭人，后能講論經義。庾乘自認為門第卑微，每次講論都坐于下座，諸生博士反而都前往與其辯論，于是學官中以下座為貴。朝廷多次征召庾乘，其都不應，時人稱之為征君。","descriptionEn":"A renowned scholar of the Eastern Han from Yanling in Yingchuan, and the founding ancestor of the Yingchuan Yu clan. Born into humble origins, Yu Cheng served as a gatekeeper at the county court in his youth. The noted scholar Guo Tai recognized his talent and urged him to pursue studies at the Academy. After entering the Academy, Yu Cheng willingly served as a laborer for fellow students, eventually mastering the exposition of the classics. Deeming his own background lowly, he always took a lower seat during academic discourses, yet scholars and Erudites alike flocked to debate with him, causing the lower seat to become honored throughout the Academy. The imperial court repeatedly summoned him to office, but he declined every summons, earning him the contemporary moniker of the ‘Summoned Gentleman.’","descriptionJp":"後漢の名士。潁川鄢陵の人で、潁川庾氏の始祖。庾乗は微賤の身の出身で、若き頃は県